Version 2.0.9 (2024/07/02)
* The status display for the first boss encounter in Lucent Citadel will now
  include tracking for Major Vulnerability, since the most commonly-used tracker
  of this effect does not adequately handle the unique nature of this encounter;
  additionally, this information, along with the health, are now dimmed for the
  side that the player is currently not on, to make it easier to visually
  distinguish which information is relevant to the player's current side
* The alerts for Brilliant and Bleak Annihilation in Lucent Citadel will now
  include a timer
* Added settings to change the highlight colors of the group-wide cooldown panel
  for the final encounter in Lucent Citadel, to better accommodate players with
  color vision deficiency
